      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAWN RUPEE (1) comes off an average performance last start when fifth at Richmond Straight over 324m behind Zipping Palmer (18.18) in a Grade 5. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to his credit. Should be very hard to beat this time. RIPPER JOE (2) ran below best last time finishing seventh (30.91) over 520m at this track from Box 4. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Likely to be thereabouts. ZIPPING KRISTOFF (8) is better than last start when fourth (20.23) in a Free For All at Goulburn over 350m. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Expected to give a good account. NANGAR ZARA (3) deserves plenty of thought over this trip.",
